{"4537040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sky Safari: FPV Drone", "steam_appid": 4537040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky Safari: FPV Drone</strong> is an open-world flight simulator where you become an aerial photographer. Using high-speed FPV drones, your mission is to explore untamed landscapes and document animals in their natural homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From snowy mountains to sunny plains, the world is yours to explore from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/370e9a59def76b139a918a136e636459.poster.avif?t=1786657633\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/370e9a59def76b139a918a136e636459.webm?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/370e9a59def76b139a918a136e636459.mp4?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real FPV Flight:</strong> Experience true-to-life drone physics. Fly in <strong>Stable Mode</strong> for smooth photos or switch to <strong>Manual Mode</strong> for full acrobatic control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildlife Photography:</strong> Find and track animals like lions, bears, and crocodiles. Be careful—stay quiet and keep your distance to get the perfect shot without scaring them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/55cb2003aed8825dd1c114b5e44188cb.poster.avif?t=1786657633\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/55cb2003aed8825dd1c114b5e44188cb.webm?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/55cb2003aed8825dd1c114b5e44188cb.mp4?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Missions:</strong> Complete photography contracts! Track a bird through the forest, follow a moving herd, or find hidden animals in the mountains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Open World:</strong> Explore huge, detailed maps including deep forests, quiet lakes, and massive cliffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Gear:</strong> Use your rewards to unlock faster drones, better cameras, and longer-lasting batteries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/7d829d27d1839641ced38169198fd5ba.poster.avif?t=1786657633\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/7d829d27d1839641ced38169198fd5ba.webm?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/7d829d27d1839641ced38169198fd5ba.mp4?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The wilderness is waiting. Are you ready for takeoff?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky Safari: FPV Drone</strong> is an open-world flight simulator where you become an aerial photographer. Using high-speed FPV drones, your mission is to explore untamed landscapes and document animals in their natural homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From snowy mountains to sunny plains, the world is yours to explore from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/370e9a59def76b139a918a136e636459.poster.avif?t=1786657633\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/370e9a59def76b139a918a136e636459.webm?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/370e9a59def76b139a918a136e636459.mp4?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real FPV Flight:</strong> Experience true-to-life drone physics. Fly in <strong>Stable Mode</strong> for smooth photos or switch to <strong>Manual Mode</strong> for full acrobatic control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildlife Photography:</strong> Find and track animals like lions, bears, and crocodiles. Be careful—stay quiet and keep your distance to get the perfect shot without scaring them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/55cb2003aed8825dd1c114b5e44188cb.poster.avif?t=1786657633\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/55cb2003aed8825dd1c114b5e44188cb.webm?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537040/extras/55cb2003aed8825dd1c114b5e44188cb.mp4?t=1786657633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>